{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just lost your job and you're ready to live a little before getting back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third game to the &quot;Bad Dog&quot; Series you'll embark (bark!), no pun intended, on a fun adventure for the next few weeks in-between jobs. Go out on dinner dates, meet new friends, and make love  in this new feature packed adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience different narrative locations, go out on different excursions and explore new mini-games in this third addition to the series. You have access to the world in your hands.... uhhh, urrrr.. paws! Sure lounging around is fun and all but you could also get laid while you're at it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This small jam-packed adventure is story oriented with day one and two out at release and more coming with future free updates which each have their unique opportunities for adventures with your furry friends. The primary game-play is point and click, however there are mini-games throughout different areas which may differ into different game styles such as retro game-play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your time off work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Congrats Angler!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018110/e82222c16503216fbbb5c9376b32e5caaba5c7fa.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Fisher!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018110/bd98987cf039ee4732d5f6657bd624e346796257.jpg"},{"name":"200 Coins! Wow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018110/f006159b2c6c5e00c6756c3b8221544d2aaba4c3.jpg"},{"name":"69 Coins Funny Coin Number","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4018110/b0fb7e3d01ebd383b152a95fc0e5ce558592d552.jpg"},{"name":"Won Asteroid Dodger!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image